        IF (`the answer of s 117.1` EQUALS JUST TRUE) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "do not apply"
        IF `the individual does so on behalf of, and under the authority of, a police force, the Canadian Forces, a visiting force within the meaning of section 2 of the Visiting Forces Act, or a department of the Government of Canada or of a province` AND (`the person possesses a firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, any prohibited ammunition or an explosive substance` OR `the person manufactures or transfers, or offers to manufacture or transfer, a firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part, any ammunition or any prohibited ammunition` OR `the person exports or imports a firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition` OR `the person exports or imports a component or part designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm` OR `the person alters a firearm so that it is capable of, or manufactures or assembles any firearm with intent to produce a firearm that is capable of, discharging projectiles in rapid succession during one pressure of the trigger` OR `the person fails to report the loss, theft or finding of any firearm, prohibited weapon, restricted weapon, prohibited device, ammunition, prohibited ammunition or explosive substance, or the destruction of any such thing` OR `the person alters a serial number on a firearm`) THEN JUST TRUE
